  "readmeFile": "Readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release Notes and Important Information\n\n-- Before You Update:\n- Always back up your projects before updating.\n- Review changes before updating.\n- Contact us if you have questions before updating.\n\n-- Siticone TextBox Advanced\n\n-- Enhancements and Bug Fixes\n- Improved Event Handling: Fixed bug causing multiple text-change events. The 'TextContentChanged' event now fires only once.\n- Responsive Validation Feedback: The validation coloring system is now instant. Text and placeholders turn red for invalid input and correctly disappear when input is valid.\n- Enhanced Placeholder Behavior: Placeholder text now integrates with validation, also turning red for invalid input.\n\n-- New Feature: International Currency Support\n- 1. Comma as Decimal Separator: Added a new 'AllowCommaAsDecimalSeparator' property to handle European currency formats.\n- 2. Smarter Parsing and Editing: The control now intelligently parses pasted values and leaves only the raw numeric value for editing.\n- 3. Bug Fix: Fixed a bug where typing a comma would incorrectly display a period.\n\n-- Designer Improvements\n- Better Organization: The Smart Tag panel has been reorganized.\n- Quick Setup Options: Added quick setup for EUR.",
